@base = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

### Levels with progress
GET {{base}}/levels

### Units of a level
GET {{base}}/levels/A1/units

### Words of a unit
GET {{base}}/units/1/words

### Answer a word
POST {{base}}/words/1/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{ "result": "correct", "hintsUsed": 1 }

### Validation error
POST {{base}}/words/1/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{ "result": "maybe" }

### Active reviews
GET {{base}}/reviews/active

### Start (or resume) a review: UNIT | LEVEL | ALL
POST {{base}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "UNIT", "unitId": 1 }

### Review state
GET {{base}}/reviews/1

### Answer the current word of a review
POST {{base}}/reviews/1/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{ "wordId": 1, "result": "correct", "hintsUsed": 0 }
